  "description": "Rig-control (CAT) abstraction for amateur-radio transceivers: get/set frequency and mode, PTT, and SWR / RF-power metering behind capability probes (IRigControl + RigCapabilities). Dependency-free; backends plug in underneath (Packet.Rig.Hamlib speaks hamlib's rigctld network protocol, Packet.Rig.Flrig speaks flrig XML-RPC). Part of the Packet.NET stack but usable standalone. Source: github.com/packet-net/packet.net.",
